    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For Joan Wetumi, pursuing a Master of Arts in Digital Journalism (MADJ) at the Aga Khan University Graduate School of Media and Communications (GSMC) was about more than just a degree. She sought a program that would combine practical skills with a rigorous academic curriculum. \"I was drawn to GSMC's strong emphasis on modern journalism and communication, and its balance of professional and academic expertise,\" she explains.",
